  "title_zh": "淮安市政府常务会议召开",
  "title_en": "Huai'an Municipal Government Holds Executive Meeting",
  "summary_zh": "8月28日，市长顾坤主持召开市政府九届第59次常务会议，研究法治政府建设、工业项目服务、消防安全、耕地保护及群众身边不正之风和腐败问题集中整治等工作。",
  "summary_en": "On Aug 28, Mayor Gu Kun chaired the 59th municipal government executive meeting, covering legal governance, industrial projects, fire safety, farmland protection, and anti-corruption efforts.",
